@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title PLANNED — white-labelling via a brand manifest (not implemented)

database "brand.env\nsingle source of truth" as BRAND <<db>>

component "BRAND_NAME  'Proveo'\nhuman-facing: dashboard title, banners, logo alt" as N1 <<app>>
component "BRAND_SLUG  'proveo'\nenv prefix · fn namespace · /opt/<slug> base" as N2 <<app>>
component "BRAND_IMAGE_ORG  'proveo'\ndocker org" as N3 <<app>>
component "BRAND_ASSET_BASE_URL\ninstaller + CDN asset root" as N4 <<app>>
component "BRAND_IDENTITY_PUML\ndiagram theme include URL" as N5 <<app>>

frame "Consumption — two layers" as CONSUME <<host>> {
  component "**Build-time templating**\nDockerfiles + baked paths resolve at build.sh;\nthe image ships already-branded" as BUILDTIME <<app>>
  component "**Runtime indirection**\nimage org · asset/install URLs · dashboard title\nlogo · puml include read from brand.env" as RUNTIME <<app>>
}

frame "Staged by mechanical difficulty" as STAGES <<host>> {
  component "**A — variables** (immediate)\ndashboard title · ASCII logo (dedupe to one source)\nimage-org default · install.sh + README asset URLs\nwrangler.toml name · puml include" as SA <<app>>
  component "**B — build-time paths**\n/opt/proveo → /opt/${BRAND_SLUG}\nin Dockerfiles + entrypoints" as SB <<app>>
  component "**C — env prefix + fn namespace**\nscripted rename PROVEO_ → ${SLUG^^}_ ,\nproveo_ → ${SLUG}_ , with a compat shim\nreading legacy PROVEO_* for one release" as SC <<error>>
  component "**D — de-personalize**\nmove the 'Address me as Executor' directive out of\nthe reusable CONVENTIONS.md / AGENTS.md template\ninto a local-only override" as SD <<app>>
}

component "brand.sh apply  /  make rebrand\nregenerates templated files + a test asserting no\nresidual hardcoded token outside brand.env" as APPLY <<app>>

BRAND ARROW_MAIN N1
BRAND ARROW_MAIN N2
BRAND ARROW_MAIN N3
BRAND ARROW_MAIN N4
BRAND ARROW_MAIN N5
BRAND ARROW_MAIN CONSUME
CONSUME ARROW_MAIN STAGES
SA ARROW_MAIN SB
SB ARROW_MAIN SC
SC ARROW_MAIN SD
STAGES ARROW_MAIN APPLY

note top of BRAND
  **Status: PLANNED — no code exists.** This is the one
  unshipped design carried over from the retired
  ""plans/"" directory; every other plan there was applied
  and its design now lives in the diagrams beside this one.

  Imported paradigm: the identity repo already models the
  discipline — diagrams pull identity from **one** upstream
  include, so changing it once updates everything. This
  generalizes that from diagrams to the whole product.
end note

note bottom of SC
  **The hard one.** ""proveo"" is compiled into ~91 tracked
  files (~483 hits under ""defs/"") with no central
  constant: function names (""proveo_egress_*""), paths
  (""/opt/proveo/lib"", ""/etc/proveo/mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem""),
  the ""PROVEO_*"" env prefix, image org, container names
  (""proveo-dind-*""), the smoke sentinel
  (""PROVEO_SMOKE_READY""), installer domain, wrangler name,
  dashboard title and a duplicated ASCII logo.

  Stage C is a mechanical rename across every shell file,
  so it must be guarded by tests and land after the Go
  substrate and Go tests are the source of truth — which
  is why this plan was sequenced last.
end note

note bottom of APPLY
  **Acceptance criteria**
  * changing ""BRAND_NAME"" / ""BRAND_SLUG"" / ""BRAND_IMAGE_ORG""
    plus one apply step rebrands the product, with a test
    proving no stray hardcoded token remains
  * docs render without a live ""proveo-ca"" URL once the
    identity include is a variable (fork target documented)
  * the reusable template carries no personal persona directive
end note
@enduml
